ile | Description |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​verify_report_numbers.py` | Verifies report metrics |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​test_calibration.py` | Runs calibration controls |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​summarize.py` | Renders calibration summaries |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​prespecification.py` | Defines the frozen calibration matrix |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​perturbations.py` | Implements perturbation operators |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​mrcio.py` | Handles MRC/STAR data |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​make_perturbed_movies.py` | Generates perturbed movies |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​layer3_pipeline.py` | Runs real-binary calibration |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​layer2_forward.py` | Runs forward-model calibration |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​layer1_inject.py` | Injects faults into micrographs |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​diagnostics.py` | Computes calibration diagnostics |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​decompose_pair.py` | Decomposes paired outputs |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​analyze.py` | Performs tiering and threshold analysis |\r\n| `tools/​calibration/​__init__.py` | Defines package documentation |\r\n| `docs/​calibration/​data/​layer3_movies.json` | Stores movie measurements |\r\n| `docs/​calibration/​data/​layer3_gain_extra.json` | Stores gain measurements |\r\n| `docs/​calibration/​data/​cpu_build_variation_decomposition.json` | Stores CPU variation evidence |\r\n| `agents/​designs/​issue_60_gate_calibration.md` | Documents the calibration design |\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/KingAlejandro/MotionCorr-standalone/new/main?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nor